[{"title":"忽雨","author":"张宇初","text":"飘风急雨燕初泥，新竹成阴小阁西。\n数卷残书香篆息，园花落尽到荼蘼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58999,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"藤","author":"王士骐","text":"手种藤花大可围，暮春小圃亦芳菲。\n黄鹂隐叶惟闻啭，紫蝶寻春不辨飞。\n满架迎风光眩眼，缘溪著雨碧侵衣。\n漫道破除情事尽，长条柔蔓转依依。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59000,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"藤","author":"于若瀛","text":"藤古结为梁，蜒蜿凭云雾。\n步之时动摇，疑驾彩虹度。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59001,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和令则题画","author":"陈继儒","text":"山村雨霁水痕加，鸭觜滩头燕尾沙。\n新结松棚试新茗，好风无力扫藤花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59002,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"兰","author":"冯琦","text":"韦曲名园好，习池胜事繁。\n午风披蕙带，秋色上苔痕。\n密树云成幄，疏篱水绕门。\n不烦除客径，吾欲藉兰荪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59003,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客赠闽兰秋来忽发两丛清香可爱","author":"文徵明","text":"灵根珍重自瓯东，绀碧垂香玉两丛。\n和露纫为湘水佩，凌风如到蕊珠宫。\n谁言别有幽贞在，我已相忘臭味中。\n老去相如才思减，临窗欲赋不能工。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59004,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写兰","author":"景翩翩","text":"道是深林种，还怜出谷香。\n不因风力紧，何以度潇湘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59005,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"兰","author":"余有丁","text":"何处幽香扑酒樽，洲中杜若畹中荪。\n纫来为佩裁为服，不许薋葹挂荜门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59006,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"紫兰","author":"景翩翩","text":"碧玉参差簇紫英，当年剩有国香名。\n风前漫结幽人佩，澧浦春深寄未成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59007,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采莲曲","author":"李淑媛","text":"南湖采莲女，日日南湖归。\n浅渚莲子满，深潭荷叶稀。\n荡桨娇无力，水溅越罗衣。\n无心却回棹，贪看鸳鸯飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59008,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"莲花","author":"申时行","text":"碧沼渟寒玉，红蕖映绿波。\n妆凝朝日丽，香逐晚风多。\n游戏金鳞出，飞扬翠羽过。\n纳凉依水榭，还续采莲歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59009,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荷风","author":"瞿佑","text":"一阵南风一阵凉，扁舟来到水云乡。\n吹开太华峰头雨，散作西湖水面香。\n清露泻珠沾翡翠，红衣坠粉妒鸳鸯。\n飘飘香袖空中举，知是谁家窈窕娘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59010,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"池莲 其一","author":"朱之蕃","text":"藕花层叠点回塘，映日随风远送香。\n翠被玉颜眠锦帐，绿鬟红粉舞霓裳。\n承将晓露珠倾斛，照彻晴波镜对妆。\n鸥鹭徊翔知眷恋，可无觞咏答韶光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59011,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"池莲 其二","author":"朱之蕃","text":"十亩横塘列芰荷，虚亭开向绮霞窝。\n娇花浥露红妆拥，密叶翻风翠袖多。\n越女翩翩偕巧笑，湘娥冉冉共凌波。\n不劳玉井峰头觅，坐对倾杯发浩歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59012,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和观莲","author":"陆树声","text":"秘省仙郎别苑东，池开新长芰荷红。\n幽芳渺渺三湘外，疏影亭亭一水中。\n香湿琼衣迷晓雾，尘消罗袜起秋风。\n玉堂归后青藜照，竞拟金莲出上宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59013,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芙蓉","author":"于若瀛","text":"入港采芙蓉，芙蓉动㴸淰。\n游鱼聚蜂房，吹作波心锦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59014,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"盆荷","author":"徐阶","text":"四面花开玉露滋，晓风翻雨夜垂垂。\n渊明酒思濂溪癖，凭仗盆池借一枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59015,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"菊","author":"申时行","text":"诛茅疏野径，种菊拟山家。\n秀擢三秋干，奇分五色葩。\n凌霜留晚节，殿岁夺春华。\n为道餐英好，东篱兴独赊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59016,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"菊","author":"唐文献","text":"西苑宸游地，东篱菊已花。\n当年誇野色，此日丽天葩。\n轻白凌寒露，深红映晚霞。\n秋英疑可茹，无复楚人嗟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59017,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西施菊","author":"瞿佑","text":"不惜金钱买冶容，移根应自馆娃宫。\n西风冷落三秋后，故国繁华一笑中。\n戏蝶留连香径晚，游人怅望屧廊空。\n莫教野鹿偷衔去，留映苏台夕照红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59018,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题葵花","author":"占城使臣","text":"花于木槿浑相似，叶比芙蓉只一般。\n五尺阑干遮不尽，独留一半与人看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59019,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水仙花","author":"梁辰鱼","text":"幽花开处月微茫，秋水凝神黯淡妆。\n绕砌露浓空见影，隔帘风细但闻香。\n瑶坛夜静黄冠湿，小洞秋深玉佩凉。\n一段凌波堪画处，至今词赋忆陈王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59020,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水仙","author":"于若瀛","text":"水花垂绿蒂，袅袅绿云轻。\n自是压群卉，谁言梅是兄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59021,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水仙花","author":"船窗","text":"如闻交佩响，疑是洛妃来。\n朔风欺罗袖，朝霜滋玉台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59022,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东山纪别","author":"圆复","text":"谷口风斜斗笠狂，米囊夹路白于霜。\n山童不掩溪头寺，一任閒云满竹廊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59023,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏蕉","author":"徐桂","text":"根自苏台徙，阴生蒋径幽。\n当空炎日障，倚槛碧云流。\n未展心如结，微舒叶渐抽。\n琐窗迷翠黛，张幕动青油。\n书借临池用，光分汗简留。\n流甘掩中土，为绤衣南州。\n只益莓苔润，翻令蕙若忧。\n荷风同委露，梧叶共鸣秋。\n梦境知谁得，人生似尔浮。\n漫劳弹事苦，终日傍林丘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59024,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"枫林","author":"于若瀛","text":"禁城玉树渐秋深，枫色凄凄满上林。\n万片作霞延日丽，几株含雾苦霜吟。\n斜连双阙辉青琐，倒影平津映碧浔。\n岐叶著飙声瑟瑟，殷红过雨色沈沈。\n杂黄间绿缘成锦，委砌飘檐埒作金。\n向夕转深娇落照，因风散响怖栖禽。\n城头迥接青岑远，殿角寒生绣幄阴。\n几度朝昏劳怅望，徘徊故苑倍萧森。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59025,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石门","author":"寥孔说","text":"石门酒薄客愁宽，谁念霜溪晓被寒。\n偶见邻舟说红叶，五更疏雨梦长干。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59026,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"马兰花","author":"舒芬","text":"金气棱棱泽国秋，马兰花发满汀洲。\n富春山下连鱼屋，采石江头映酒楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59027,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏虞美人草","author":"孙七政","text":"蔷薇开尽绿阴凉，西国名花此际芳。\n夜月空悬汉宫镜，幽姿犹带楚云妆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59028,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"香阴","author":"通润","text":"山中多药苗，往往发香气。\n不知采药人，曾嗅此香未。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59029,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻芷","author":"德祥","text":"白芷花开绕屋香，一时秋思入江乡。\n云多水阔人难见，楚竹歌声动夕阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59030,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水荇","author":"彭绍贤","text":"泉分石窦泻珠光，坐挹矶边水荇香。\n何处歌声最幽窕，临流那复羡沧浪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59031,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日写巨然茟意与若休","author":"李日华","text":"山光沉绿树酣黄，九月江南欲试霜。\n独坐滩头不垂钓，蓼花风急送渔榔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59032,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苔","author":"朱谋㬜","text":"布叶如钱个个青，不争要路占閒庭。\n风前印鹤移罡步，雨后留蜗作篆形。\n生阁久萦词客恨，入碑多蚀古人铭。\n红英堕地交相映，小屐跫然未忍停。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59033,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居杂咏","author":"吴鼎芳","text":"苔花满径绿云凉，嫩竹离离覆短墙。\n院静昼长人不到，一帘风袅一炉香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59034,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏萍","author":"阙名","text":"锦鳞密砌不容针，只为根儿做不深。\n曾与白云争水面，岂容明月下波心。\n几番浪打应难灭，数阵风吹不复沉。\n多少鱼龙藏在厎，渔翁无处下钩寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59035,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蒲剑","author":"朱之蕃","text":"萍化芹香水国春，蒲抽铓锷剑光新。\n不资淬砺能全德，常合雌䧺若有神。\n浴鹭忘情时振羽，潜蛟惧截欲存身。\n江干森立非无意，待剖双鱼慰远人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59036,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春草","author":"陈德懿","text":"无人种春草，随意发芳丛。\n绿遍郊原外，青回远近中。\n羃烟粘落絮，和雨衬残红。\n不解王孙去，凄凄对晚风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59037,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草茵","author":"朱之蕃","text":"青葱初向烧痕分，陌上池边积渐殷。\n风落繁英舒蜀锦，云连远岫蹙湘纹。\n佳人斗巧披香径，狂客挥杯藉夕曛。\n不待蛩吟秋露冷，閒眠先自惜芳芬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59038,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓过横塘","author":"戒襄","text":"半幅蒲帆九里汀，石湖秋水接天青。\n舟人指点蘼芜外，一带青山是洞庭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59039,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"步虚词 其三","author":"荪谷","text":"王母云车五色麟，白鸾前导向西巡。\n天章晓奏虚皇殿，仙桂花开八万春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59040,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"步虚词 其四","author":"荪谷","text":"仙岛焚香礼玉虚，紫麟催驾五云车。\n西宫侍女多娇笑，录尽三天未见书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59041,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"狮子","author":"夏言","text":"金眸玉爪目悬星，群兽闻知尽骇惊。\n怒慑熊罴威凛凛，雄驱虎豹气英英。\n曾闻西国常驯养，今出中华应太平。\n却羡文殊能服尔，稳骑驾驭下天京。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59042,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居杂咏","author":"慧浸","text":"行到深深一翠微，人多畏虎闭山扉。\n我今最爱兹山住，虎迹多时人迹稀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59043,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居诗","author":"法杲","text":"青山叠叠绕珠林，磬响时兼流水音。\n虎不避人人避虎，虎能先我息机心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59044,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵王敏文待制燕京杂咏","author":"来复","text":"晓宴皇姑拜上家，金钱满赐橐驼车。\n黄门前道飞鞚过，貂帽斜簪利市花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59045,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题赵松雪马图","author":"来复","text":"振鬣长鸣产月支，玉关风急贡来时。\n五花狮子真龙种，赐出黄门不敢骑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59046,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"驴","author":"梁小玉","text":"买得青驴捷似梭，松云萝月任婆娑。\n还嫌踏碎娇花影，款款扶缰倩墨娥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59047,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"牛图","author":"清濋","text":"春光寂寂烟晕晴，春风水水波痕明，溪南溪北小坡平。\n我却骑牛向溪曲，溪曲嫩草嫩如玉，记得当时农事足。\n倒指数来三十年，今观此图犹宛然，只多舐犊双崖边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59048,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白牛为日本纯上人赋","author":"来复","text":"耕云不住海门东，牧向楞伽小朵峰。\n露地已忘调服力，雪山谁识去来踪。\n放归祇树随羊鹿，种就昙花伴象龙。\n一色天阑头角别，水晶池沼玉芙蓉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59049,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"栖云楼晏坐效寒山偈","author":"殷迈","text":"对雨千峰静，看山百虑轻。\n昨宵明月夜，露地白牛生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59050,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨涧牛","author":"如兰","text":"溪岸野桥横，乌犍带犊行。\n无人挂书读，雨外候春耕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59051,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画牛","author":"普慈","text":"林下逍遥饱则眠，何人能似尔安然。\n因思昔日陶弘景，金作笼头不易牵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59052,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮景","author":"申光汉","text":"树密深浓翠，孤烟淡作云。\n前村闻犬吠，暗路草中分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59053,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬日穆湖村居同蕴辉上人赋","author":"智舷","text":"买得渔蓑与钓纶，天寒日暮水无鳞。\n浩歌一曲知何处，犬吠芦花不见人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59054,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄神乐观邓仙官","author":"来复","text":"开遍溪头巨胜花，雪精双引紫云车。\n忽传青鸟催春宴，烂醉金桃阿母家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59055,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"恭题黑兔图","author":"张四维","text":"黑兔人间少，疑从北极来。\n圣朝今再见，瑞牒喜重开。\n玉杵成灵药，瑶池荐寿杯。\n周罝应有咏，梁赋不须裁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59056,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"恭题黑兔图应制","author":"申时行","text":"梁苑驯游日，周京率舞时。\n重阴符水德，千载表宸禧。\n似与阳乌并，还将雾豹疑。\n玉衡光乍掩，县圃色全移。\n?药参神鼎，开罝赖圣慈。\n干城犹在野，应诵国风诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59057,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃花小禽图","author":"德祥","text":"檐外雨初晴，幽禽四五声。\n桃花无限思，留客看清明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59058,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨晴","author":"夏云英","text":"海棠初种竹新移，流水潺潺入小池。\n春雨乍晴风日好，一声啼鸟过花枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59059,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题鹤轩图","author":"姚广孝","text":"幽人适野意，崇轩起山隈。\n凉风响涧木，晴霞明砌苔。\n荆扉夕不掩，多应放鹤来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59060,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"野鹤","author":"朱之蕃","text":"劲翮凌风掠远云，一声清唳九霄闻。\n巢松不恋乘轩宠，警露时留篆籀文。\n注顶丹成迎日彩，昂身玉立出鸡群。\n朝元应待仙真御，隐映青山白雪纷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59061,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬景","author":"张宇初","text":"养就还丹不怕寒，独骑黄鹄上云端。\n笑谈借得天家雪，散作琪花满石坛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59062,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"清濋","text":"寂寂虚堂独坐时，小窗推起更思维。\n江城万井烟花白，月到松头鹤未知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59063,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词","author":"沈琼莲","text":"香雾濛濛罩碧窗，青灯的的灿银釭。\n内人何处教吹管，惊起庭前鹤一双。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59064,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻雁","author":"德祥","text":"八月凉风起，高飞乱入云。\n度关成一序，遵渚动千群。\n菰米沈寒雨，芦花散夕曛。\n一声江上过，独客最先闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59065,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雒城闻雁","author":"项兰贞","text":"明月照苍苔，横空一雁来。\n影翻飞叶堕，声带晚风回。\n塞北征人思，闺中少妇哀。\n江南别业在，丛桂几枝开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59066,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻雁","author":"郑梦周","text":"行旅忽闻雁，仰看天宇清。\n数声和月落，一点入云横。\n锦字回燕塞，新愁满洛城。\n疏灯孤馆夜，何限故园情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59067,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孤雁","author":"瞿佑","text":"失伴离群不惮劳，此心终不在蓬蒿。\n百年海内皆兄弟，万里云间一羽毛。\n夜月相随形影在，秋风独立性情高。\n鹓行鹭序休相笑，朋党何须似尔曹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59068,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雁字","author":"朱之蕃","text":"长空清迥净秋云，杖倚斜阳数雁群。\n吹隔狂飙存断简，翔依沙溆见回纹。\n霞江点缀摩崖碣，芦岸联翩白练裙。\n衡岳峰高归羽急，疑探二酉发奇文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59069,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雁","author":"朱之蕃","text":"郊原旷望入秋深，序列南翔见候禽。\n堕影高空随落木，蜚声午夜杂寒砧。\n湘江霜月连玄塞，北海音书到上林。\n矰缴未须劳弋慕，平沙远水寄閒心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59070,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻雁","author":"姚广孝","text":"鸣雁为离群，馀哀度水云。\n那知故乡夜，亦似客中闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59071,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题一雁图","author":"德祥","text":"万里江湖一叶身，来时逢雪又逢春。\n天南地北年年客，只有芦花似故人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":59072,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]